# ─── Wake Word Detection (Porcupine) ───────────
# Required for hands-free "Muse" wake word activation.
# Get a free AccessKey at https://console.picovoice.ai/
# Then create a custom wake word "Muse" and download the .ppn file
# Place it in /public/ and update useWakeWord.js to use it.
# For testing without a custom .ppn, the built-in "Computer" keyword is used.
#
# Example:
# VITE_PICOVOICE_ACCESS_KEY=your_free_key_here
VITE_PICOVOICE_ACCESS_KEY=
